/*World types:
D1 always starts from left and D2 always starts from right.
In the the cases with numbers over 100, a player-controlled agent takes the place of the original D1, labelled P, facing right.
The agent originally labelled D2 will now be labelled D1.
Moving:
    Right arrow: Move right (forward)
    Left arrow: Move left (reverse)
    Up arrow: Pull into passing place on left (has to be 1 space ahead or 1 space behind)

1-6: 2 drivers.
    1: PP in middle to left of d1. (Q4 Scenario)
    2: PP behind to left of d1.
    3: PP behind to right of d1. (Q5 Scenario)
    4: PP behind to left of d2. (Q6 Scenario but D2 CAN reverse)
    5: PP behind to left of d1 AND PP behind to the right of d2.
    6: No PP.
7-10: 3 drivers.
    7: PP in middle to left of d1, extra car behind d2.
    8: PP in middle to right of d1, extra car behind d2. (Q7 Scenario)
    9: PP behind to left of d1, extra car behind d1. (Q9 Scenario)
    10: PP in middle to the left of d1 AND behind to the left of d1 AND behind to the left of d2, extra car behind d1.
11-12: 4 drivers.
    11: PP in middle to right of d1. 3 drivers on each side(Q8 Scenario)
    12: PP in middle to right of d1 AND behind to the left of d1 AND behind to the left of d6. 3 drivers on each side.
13-14: 6 drivers.
    13: PP in middle to right of d1. 3 drivers on each side(Q8 Scenario)
    14: PP in middle to right of d1 AND behind to the left of d1 AND behind to the left of d6. 3 drivers on each side.


101-106: 1 player 1 driver.
    1: PP in middle to left of player. (Q4 Scenario)
    2: PP behind to left of player.
    3: PP behind to right of player. (Q5 Scenario)
    4: PP behind to left of player. (Q6 Scenario but D1 CAN reverse)
    5: PP behind to left of player AND PP behind to the right of player.
    6: No PP.
107-110: 1 player, 2 drivers.
    7: PP in middle to left of player, extra car behind d1.
    8: PP in middle to right of player, extra car behind d1. (Q7 Scenario)
    9: PP behind to left of player, extra car behind player. (Q9 Scenario)
    10: PP in middle to the left of player AND behind to the left of player AND behind to the left of d1, extra car behind player.
111-112: 1 player, 3 drivers.
    11: PP in middle to right of player. (Q8 Scenario). 1 driver ahead of player, 2 oncoming drivers.
    12: PP in middle to right of player AND behind to the left of player AND behind to the left of d1. 1 driver ahead of player, 2 oncoming drivers.
*/

MAS main {

    //(world option number, number of agents)
    environment: example.Env(308,3)

    agents: //driver #3;
            //player #1;
            driverq_nocomm #3;
            //driverq_comm #4;
            //driverq_hol #4;
            //driverquestion #4;

    aslSourcePath: "src/agt";
}
